<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-9055] [ML] SVM throws NPE in case of empty partitions</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9055</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Method calculateUpdates throws NPE in case of empty partitions. Reduce function user in this method doesn&apos;t handle correctly empty arguments ((a, b) -&amp;gt; a == null ? b : a.plus(b))).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We need to fix this reduce function or update Partition Based Dataset so that it doesn&apos;t emit empty arguments.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
